{"id":"62eb7ad1df","t":"Third-rate Martial Family Becomes the Best Under Heaven","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/5f9be58b26dcbe5a4bc339d0405a7cc7-193x278.jpg","n":31,"l":31,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"third-rate-martial-family-becomes-the-best-under-heaven"},"u":1795038711968,"desc":"من نفس الأستوديو الذي قدم لكم: و رغم أنه انتزع لقب أعظم سيافٍ متجول، لم تكن المشكلة يوماً في موهبة بايك يانغ-هوي، بل في عائلته “عشيرة بايك” المغمورة التي تقبع في قاع الموريم. بعد سقوطه في كمينٍ قاتل، يستيقظ يانغ-هوي ليرى نفسه طفلاً في الثامنة من عمره بفرصة ذهبية لإعادة أمجاد عشيرته. بذكريات معاركه السابقة وموهبة لا نظير لها، يسحق يانغ-هوي كل من يقف في طريقه. هذه المرة، لن يُهزم، ولن يقبل بأقل من جعل اسم عائلته يتردد في أرجاء العالم كأقوى عشيرة تحت السماء!","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["إنتقام","اثاره","اكشن","بطل غير اعتيادي","ثأر","خيال"],"src":{"ml":"third-rate-martial-family-becomes-the-best-under-heaven"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"third-rate-martial-family-becomes-the-best-under-heaven|/manga/third-rate-martial-family-becomes-the-best-under-heaven/1/"},"2":{"ml":"third-rate-martial-family-becomes-the-best-under-heaven|/manga/third-rate-martial-family-becomes-the-best-under-heaven/2/"},"3":{"ml":"third-rate-martial-family-becomes-the-best-under-heaven|/manga/third-rate-martial-family-becomes-the-best-under-heaven/3/"},"4":{"ml":"third-rate-martial-family-becomes-the-best-under-heaven|/manga/third-rate-martial-family-becomes-the-best-under-heaven/4/"},"5":{"ml":"third-rate-martial-family-becomes-the-best-under-heaven|/manga/third-rate-martial-family-becomes-the-best-under-heaven/5/"},"6":{"ml":"third-rate-martial-family-becomes-the-best-under-heaven|/manga/third-rate-martial-family-becomes-the-best-under-heaven/6/"},"7":{"ml":"third-rate-martial-family-becomes-the-best-under-heaven|/manga/third-rate-martial-family-becomes-the-best-under-heaven/7/"},"8":{"ml":"third-rate-martial-family-becomes-the-best-under-heaven|/manga/third-rate-martial-family-becomes-the-best-under-heaven/